    "text": "<p>Power, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo></math><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi><br /><br />Or <math><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p>Or <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> ....... (1)<br /><br />Now, <math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp; [Using (1)]<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math></p>",
